{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Calibri;}}\fs22  Trading Platform Operational Status & Roadmap\line \line Category: Trading Platform  System Updates\line Last Updated: October 2025\line \line  Current Platform Status\line \line The US Capital Private Bank (USCPB) Trading Platform is currently in live interface preview mode, allowing clients and early testers to explore the finalized design, dashboard navigation, and wallet framework in preparation for full activation.\line \line At this stage, live trading, transfers, and cryptocurrency conversions remain temporarily disabled while the final market APIs and compliance modules are connected.\line All prices and performance indicators displayed in the dashboard are for demonstration purposes and do not reflect live markets. Currently, Only The Back End Does.\line \line  Features in Final Development\line \line Feature\line Description\line Status\line \line Live Market Data Feeds\line Institutional-grade liquidity integrations providing accurate, real-time crypto pricing.\line  Final Integration\line \line Wallet Functions\line Secure trading, transfer, and conversion between crypto, fiat, and USCPBGOLD.\line  QA Validation\line \line Trading Engine\line Smart order routing, on-chain execution, and automatic settlement.\line  Completing Internal Testing\line \line Settlement Gateway\line Treasury synchronization between fiat, crypto, and gold-backed stablecoin systems.\line  Under Compliance Review\line \line AI Market Analytics\line Intelligent performance tracking and predictive trading insights.\line  Scheduled for Phase II\line \line  Accelerated Activation Timeline\line \line The platform is entering its final 25 week deployment phase, during which the following actions are being completed:\line \line -\line  Full integration of live liquidity and exchange APIs\line \line -\line  Activation of wallet and transfer functionality\line \line -\line  Compliance validation under Divine Law Trust governance\line \line -\line  Final system testing and load balancing for public release\line \line  Target Launch Window: Within 25 weeks from this update.\line Early-access accounts will be activated first, followed by live access for all verified clients.\line \line  Support & Testing Program\line \line To ensure efficient coordination and faster rollout, USCPB has established a dedicated support channel for all trading-related tickets and feature requests.\line \line  Department: US CAPITAL TRADING WEBSITE  Updates & Suggestions\line \line Clients, testers, and internal officers are encouraged to:\line \line -\line Visit https://projects.uscpb.net\line \line -\line From the Services drop-down menu, select\line  US CAPITAL TRADING WEBSITE  Updates & Suggestions\line \line -\line Click Open Ticket\line \line -\line Use the subject line:\line US CAPITAL TRADING WEBSITE  Updates & Suggestions\line \line -\line Include detailed information  screenshots, feature ideas, or error reports  to help accelerate system improvements and testing feedback loops.\line \line This organized reporting structure allows our development and QA teams to log, prioritize, and resolve issues efficiently, helping expedite the platforms final release.\line \line  Security & Compliance\line \line The USCPB Trading Platform operates strictly under the banks Express Trust and Divine Law jurisdiction, ensuring all client activity, asset handling, and transaction operations conform to non-statutory banking protocols.\line All modules undergo continuous security hardening and compliance certification to ensure maximum protection before public activation.\line \line  Questions & Early Access\line \line For participation in live testing, feature validation, or early access enrollment, please contact:\line  customerservice@uscapitalprivatebank.com\line  https://uscapitalprivatebank.com\line \line Only verified USCPB clients with approved KYC profiles will receive activation credentials.\line \line  US Capital Private Bank  Knowledge Base\line \line Email: customerservice@uscapitalprivatebank.com\line Website: https://uscapitalprivatebank.com\line Phone: +971 529 926 005\line \line Thank you,\line US Capital Private Bank Client Relations}